	"hardwareControls": [
		"25 mini keys",
		"Four assignable knobs in two banks",
		"Assignable data push encoder",
		"Octave and program buttons"
	],
	"notice": "This is the 25-mini-key iRig Keys 2 Mini, not the 37-key versions. It has no pitch/modulation wheels or external pedal input. The four assignable knobs provide two banks; assignments depend on the selected setup. Match the output MIDI channel to the receiving instrument. Use the correct IK 2.5 mm MIDI adapter; ordinary 3.5 mm TRS MIDI adapters do not fit. The headphone output is audio, not a MIDI connection. Exact browser MIDI port aliases have not been verified; select this profile manually. DIN-connected hardware appears under the MIDI interface name. Physical controls are unbound and this profile does not supply a complete MIDI implementation. Diagrams show selected physical controls with illustrative positions; consult the linked manufacturer references for the full panel.",
